# task-not-discarded. Adapted from EYE reasoning examples (MIT, Jos De Roo).
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/n3c/notIn_query.n3
# The task document is embedded; absence is checked within that graph.

@prefix : <http://example.org/test#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

:task1 a :CompositeTask.

:task2 a :CompositeTask.

:tasks :graph {

:task1 a :CompositeTask.

:task2 a :CompositeTask.

}.
{ ?Task a :CompositeTask. :tasks :graph ?Graph. ?Graph log:notIncludes {?Task a :DiscardedTask} }
    => { ?Task a :NotDiscardedTask }.
